SCHEDULE: {"1":"Hana","2":"Ann","3":"Dev","4":"Ben","5":"Cara","6":"Finn","7":"Gus","8":"Elif","9":"Ivo"}
CONFIDENCE: 98

Ben = Dev+1 and Cara = Dev+2. Finn can't take either of those slots, so Finn is at least Dev+3, and Gus (immediately after Finn) is at least Dev+4. Cara and Gus have exactly one person between them, so Gus = Cara+2 = Dev+4, which forces Finn = Dev+3. Elif and Ivo must come after Gus, so Dev+6 ≤ 9, which gives Dev = 3. That puts Elif at 8 and Ivo at 9. Ann must come before Dev and be immediately after Hana, so Hana = 1 and Ann = 2.
